  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-01.htm",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: This place - my home - has been untouched by the passage of time. But now, the winds of change have begun to blow ... even here amidst the beauty of Heine. While change often brings with it uncertainty and even anxiety, I sense something indescribable on the wind. Something omino…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; (talker.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I hope so too.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00237_WindsOfChange 30899-02.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00237_WindsOfChange",
     "event": "30899-02.htm",
     "quest": 237,
     "to": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-02.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-00.html": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-00.html",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: This change may prove less than desirable. I hesitate to put you in danger... (Only characters who are level 82 or higher may undertake this quest.)",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT (talker.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-07.html",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: I cannot provide you any more help. Find Sir Iason Heine in the village warehouse and speak with him.",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1|4"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-10.html": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-10.html",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: Roman? Ah, you mean the Head Blacksmith! He should be in the blacksmith's shop, as you would expect.",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-11.html": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-11.html",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: ???? You mean by Eva's High Priest? He should be in the Great Temple of Eva...",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 3"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-08.html",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: I have nothing more to say. You should have already arrived to the destination if you used the teleport while chatting like this. For Dr. Helvetica , go to the Reed Field of Silence; for Priestess Athenia , please go to the Reed Field of Whisper.",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 5|6"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00464_Oath/30899-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00464_Oath/30899-01.html",
   "quest": 464,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: Greetings, traveler. Can I help you...?",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond >1; st.getInt(\"npc\") == npcId"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say that you came to give her this book",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00464_Oath end_quest",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00464_Oath",
     "event": "end_quest",
     "quest": 464,
     "to": "Q00464_Oath/30899-02.html",
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-02.htm",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: As you're not from around here, it is not surprising to find that you are unaware of the alarm brewing within our community. Recently, monsters named Mucrokians have appeared in the Field of Silence and the Field of Whispers . And while they do resemble their Crokian brethren, th…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Is there more?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00237_WindsOfChange 30899-03.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00237_WindsOfChange",
     "event": "30899-03.htm",
     "quest": 237,
     "to": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-03.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-03.htm",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: In the north, a dwarf by the name of Dr. Helvetica has appeared in the Fields of Silence. A more dastardly fellow you will never find. If the rumors are true, Dr. Helvetica's plan is to conquer that area by force! It is said that he plans to lead an army of Enchanted Golems throu…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"It sounds like Athenia is doing well enough.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00237_WindsOfChange 30899-04.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00237_WindsOfChange",
     "event": "30899-04.htm",
     "quest": 237,
     "to": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-04.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-04.htm",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: While Athenia is doing all she can to thwart Dr. Helvetica's plans, the land is crying out for your assistance. Perhaps the providence of Evas has sent you here to us. The current state of affairs cannot last. Won't you lend a hand? Which side you choose to support is up to you...",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Which one do you think I should help?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00237_WindsOfChange 30899-05.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00237_WindsOfChange",
     "event": "30899-05.htm",
     "quest": 237,
     "to": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-05.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-05.htm": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-05.htm",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: I place the choice in your hands. But before making it, you must learn more about both sides. Both sides are seeking assistance from Sir Iason Heine, since he exerts a vast influence here. I suggest you speak with him and ask his advice. Do you understand?",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say yes.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00237_WindsOfChange 30899-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00237_WindsOfChange",
     "event": "30899-06.html",
     "quest": 237,
     "to": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-06.html",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00237_WindsOfChange/30899-06.html",
   "quest": 237,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: I hope so. May Eva bless your efforts, my friend. You will find Iason Heine in the warehouse of this village. Take this letter with you, and good luck!",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00464_Oath/30899-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00464_Oath/30899-02.html",
   "quest": 464,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Flauen: Hey, I know this book...?! ...Where did you find this?? Incredible! Man... this thing brings back some memories eh? Well, like most things I guess you had to have been there. This was very nice of you. Dear Sophia... I wonder what she's up to anymore. Probably looks more like her…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Flauen",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
